:: MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Domus Street">>
<</if>>
宅邸街七号院墙外的绿色旧邮筒底部卡着一封没有贴邮票的牛皮信封。<<mpAmbient>>你放缓脚步环顾四周，发现牛皮信封边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[缓步走回宅邸街口 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "取出牛皮信封 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_domus_postboxenvelope")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你顺着宅邸街七的掩护打开牛皮信封，将里面的旧银币与未鉴定古物揣进衣袋。<span class="green">你在宅邸街七顺遂起出了牛皮信封。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	牛皮信封卡得颇紧，你伸手拨弄时指节蹭在粗糙的边角上，擦出了一道红印。<span class="red">指节被牛皮信封边角刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回宅邸 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">取出牛皮信封 (0:05)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "沿石缝抽出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-domus-postboxenvelope">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_domus_postboxenvelope_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你压住边角缓缓抽出，将牛皮信封连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你完好取出了牛皮信封。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走回宅邸 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	街口忽然传来路人交谈声，你动作一滞，袖口蹭上了一点浮灰。<span class="red">为免引人注意，你先停手退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回外围通道 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">沿石缝抽出 (0:06)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Barb Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Barb Street">>
<</if>>
倒钩街治安亭后方的电线杆下丢着一只被踩瘪的锡制警哨盒。<<mpAmbient>>你驻足留心观察四周动静，发现锡制警哨盒边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "取出锡制警哨盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_barb_crushedwhistletin")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你顺着倒钩街治的掩护打开制警哨盒，把内藏的旧银币与古物妥善收入囊中。<span class="green">你在倒钩街治顺遂起出了制警哨盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好器物返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	制警哨盒卡得颇紧，你伸手拨弄时指节蹭在粗糙的边角上，擦出了一道红印。<span class="red">指节被制警哨盒边角刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">取出锡制警哨盒 (0:05)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "顺墙根暗槽移出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-barb-crushedwhistletin">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_barb_crushedwhistletin_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你屏住呼吸拨开暗扣，将锡制警哨盒连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的锡制警哨盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	远处响起马车碾过石板的声响，你手腕微偏没能着力。<span class="red">你收回手指，决定等街面安静些再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回倒钩街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">顺墙根暗槽移出 (0:06)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles [nobr]
