	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回多瑙河 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">挑开眼镜盒扣 (0:05)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
