<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "垫帕子取出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-danube-irongatespectacles">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_danube_irongatespectacles_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你指尖发力挑开铜扣，将丝绒眼镜盒连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的丝绒眼镜盒。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转回多瑙河 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	一阵穿堂冷风吹迷了眼，你探手的角度差了半寸。<span class="red">指尖擦过冰冷的外壳，只能暂且作罢。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
