:: MP World Wolf HitchingRingPouch [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "wolf">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Wolf Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Wolf Street">>
<</if>>
狼街神殿外墙的拴马石环下压着一只绣花小荷包。<<mpAmbient>>你停步凑近端详边角细节，发现绣花小荷包边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退到通风处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
